      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "Video",
          "url": "https://vimeo.com/440732563",
          "caption": ""
        },
        {
          "kind": "Text",
          "text": "<p>Let’s face it, most of us avoid the book of Revelation… There’s so much symbolism, and the apocalyptic language can be confusing to navigate. But Revelation is the only book of the Bible that has a blessing attached. And amongst many other things, we believe it will inspire you to live with expectancy and hope, to persevere in times of difficulty, and to maintain an eternal perspective.</p><p>This 16-week experience took us through the entire book of Revelation. View past messages or engage with the digital booklets below.</p>",
          "collapsed_title": ""
        }
      ]
    },
